         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Exercising Feet and Hands\n\nIn this game you will practice counting with your feet and hands. Follow the steps below to see how numbers connect to your body.\n\nFirst, choose how many times the feet step or jump and how many times the hands clap. Then choose the speed. Finally, do the movements yourself with the app.\n\nYou can also change the skin color of the hands and feet to match your own in Menu → Options.",
